{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nThe day in Amsterdam was full. I posted my letter and finally saw the second part of the gallery; the old town hall, now the imperial palace, is grand, though I suspect the royal family finds it merely a stopover. I also visited a church with coloured windows that caught the light beautifully. Lunch was a simple affair of fish with Dr. Besseling, a Catholic, which gave us ample time to discuss the state of things here.\n\nI left by diligence at five. The journey is tiring but the air is good. I think of you and the boys in Berlin, especially Karl and Immanuel. Please keep Ludwig’s studies steady; discipline remains the foundation of any true learning. I hope to write again soon. Do not worry about the delay in my letters; the roads are busy.\n\nYour affectionate\nGeorg"}}],"created":1795218820,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":178,"prompt_tokens":940,"total_tokens":1118,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-6M4Lf0QtTWQgK2Zo58eaqUteg9B9HKKs","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":940,"prompt_ms":1066.081,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.1341287234042552,"prompt_per_second":881.7341271441852,"predicted_n":178,"predicted_ms":4260.906,"predicted_per_token_ms":24.072915254237287,"predicted_per_second":41.54046111319987}}